.TH MBPFAN 8 "User Manuals"
.SH NAME
mbpfan \-  A simple daemon to control fan speed on Apple computers (Gentoo fork of mbpfan)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B mbpfan [OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B mbpfan 
is a daemon that uses input from coretemp module and sets the fan speed using the applesmc module. 
This fork targets Gentoo Linux on older Intel Macs. It assumes any number of processors and fans (max. 10).
.SH OPTIONS
.IP -h
Show the help screen
.IP -f
Run in the foreground
.IP -v
Be (alot) verbose
.SH FILES
.I /etc/mbpfan.conf
.RS
The system wide configuration file.
.RE
